    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b574fc41492f06f043463cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天的训练到此为止",
      "source_fingerprint": "eda50940e38f77300e61d754cbd631920b8cc2f20ff9faa62ac6e6a949a8cb81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1034/storytimeline_041034007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bb9ee071b30bd2ae8e23d0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稻荷一的努力令人惊叹，但她实在太拼了。\n得让她好好放松一下才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fc33c9586972e518a8b7098bae0f111231c5467036c24c1c31644d0c732d307",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1034/storytimeline_041034007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e14334777f3ae614f94d6b7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我告诉她，我不认为她在勉强自己，\n但我觉得她把自己逼得太紧了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdc1d34c04e80cddf4314c18582325b944a72a28d33ca300430a7b50b6691be7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1034/storytimeline_041034007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:592d5862d4f21c0336492c89",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从稻荷一性格可以判断，她一定扛起了很多东西。\n虽说目前那些负担是推动她的原动力──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c3891cff9c631382273520bfe66044b4bdd2830fd41ed5b16cf3b7b0ed9b15c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1034/storytimeline_041034007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:018efa7bd5aa42bded12672f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但光是一直被推着走，不久后肩上的东西会成为压着她的重担。\n所以我希望她稍微放松一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1ed639bc3ccbaafe8c2b7c3a5c31b26f0a803a2346f98d0c201b271d3e1c157",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1034/storytimeline_041034007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f7b48538c5120d8b8cc743e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们一起扛吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9a1405b420cf165cf041e155cb9be1a2b812b2b8618e3a96b5c75529d1ba74f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1034/storytimeline_041034007.json",
